{"id":"db8da4f25311c498","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-decomposition.md","title":"Explicit Finite Boolean Decomposition","display":"lem-gl-decomposition — Explicit Finite Boolean Decomposition","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-decomposition","aliases":["89-lem-gl-decomposition"],"display":"lem-gl-decomposition — Explicit Finite Boolean Decomposition","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-decomposition — Explicit Finite Boolean Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" href=\"?note=0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" title=\"89-df-gl-normal-form\">89-df-gl-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是模态文字类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是子公式和字母集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是命题原子载体。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{at}(A)=\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\operatorname{at}(A)=\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是局部有限原子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\)</span> 含空序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\exists m\\le 2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}\\;\\exists\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\left[\n\\left(A\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i&lt;m\\rangle\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma(i))\\;\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\exists m\\le 2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}\\;\\exists\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\left[\n\\left(A\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i&lt;m\\rangle\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma(i))\\;\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4–5（本库展开）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>按固定语法编码排列有限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{at}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{at}(A)\\)</span>。对每个赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:\\operatorname{at}(A)\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(u:\\operatorname{at}(A)\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的盒子公式当作原子计算布尔值。每个使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为真的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 生成一项：按顺序取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(a)=1\">\\(u(a)=1\\)</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg a\">\\(\\neg a\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(a)=0\">\\(u(a)=0\\)</span>）的合取，再析取全部项。任意全原子赋值恰满足与其有限限制一致的唯一完整项，所以与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 等价。此等价属于既有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。\n最多有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}\\)</span> 项；每项取自原子的正负文字，不添加字母。把内层盒子也纳入原子集仅会增加不影响求值的坐标，不损害证明。全假与全真情形由空析取和空合取覆盖。这里给了实际有限构造和命题证明，无需误称其为原书的特殊 GL 分解定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{at}(A)=\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cap\\mathrm{At}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\exists m\\le 2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}\\;\\exists\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathcal L_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\left[\n\\left(A\\leftrightarrow\\bigvee\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma(i):i<m\\rangle\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i<m\\;\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma(i))\\;\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{at}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"u:\\operatorname{at}(A)\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"u(a)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg a","display":false},{"tex":"u(a)=0","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{|\\operatorname{at}(A)|}","display":false}],"bytes":2139,"backlinks":[{"id":"588e8fcba7d283dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b3c8928cef7eaa4","71b4f56d6213ff7c","81d2de5abb2876b6","0006800fa1c85177"]}